{"id":96,"date":"2026-07-09T14:25:53","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T14:25:53","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/localhost:8181\/rental-hvac-in-state-college-what-landlords-keep-missing\/"},"modified":"2026-07-14T19:43:53","modified_gmt":"2026-07-14T19:43:53","slug":"rental-hvac-in-state-college-what-landlords-keep-missing","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/rental-hvac-in-state-college-what-landlords-keep-missing\/","title":{"rendered":"Every August Turnover Wrecks State College Rental HVAC"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--sand has-tint-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignfull has-media-on-the-right s-hero-split wp-elements-6ea384917585e691727920e313bf6d96\" style=\"grid-template-columns:auto 50%\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading s-hero-split__text wp-block-heading\">August turns 3,000 rentals at once<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every lease in this town expires the same two weeks. The equipment inside those units keeps the score.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Get Your Numbers<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-rowhouse-2.png\" alt=\"rowhouse - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1770\" style=\"object-fit:cover;height:100%\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-rowhouse-2.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-rowhouse-2-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-rowhouse-2-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-rowhouse-2-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s-trust-bar\"><div class=\"s-trust__item\">15+ Years Serving PA<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Licensed &amp; Insured<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Same-Day Emergency<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Local to Your Area<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--cream has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">State College runs on the academic clock<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Between the converted houses off Beaver and College Avenues, the apartment blocks south of campus, and the townhouse clusters out in Ferguson and Patton Townships, thousands of units flip tenants every August. Each turnover is a fresh start for the people. For the furnace, the air conditioner, and the thermostat that stay behind, it is one more year on an odometer nobody is watching.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Owners managing a duplex themselves and property managers running whole buildings hit the same three walls: tenants who run equipment hard and report trouble late, thermostats that invite abuse, and a maintenance schedule copied from owner-occupied housing that ignores the calendar actually governing this market \u2014 Penn State&#039;s academic year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">What follows is a working playbook for all three, written for Centre County landlords who would rather manage HVAC on purpose than by surprise.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right\" style=\"grid-template-columns:auto 50%\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tenant occupancy ages equipment faster<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A four-bedroom unit rented to four unrelated adults does not behave like a family home. Four schedules means somebody is nearly always in the unit, so the setback hours that give an owner-occupied furnace its rest simply never arrive.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Add the habits that come with paying flat-rate utilities \u2014 heat running with a window cracked, air conditioning set to sixty-six because it is not their compressor \u2014 and seasonal runtime can land well above what the same equipment would see in a single-family neighborhood. Late reporting compounds the wear. A homeowner hears a new rattle from the blower and calls someone that week.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A tenant hears it, decides it is not their problem, and mentions it at move-out \u2014 after the loose blower wheel has chewed through a bearing. Small, cheap symptoms in rentals routinely age into large repairs purely because nobody with a financial stake in the equipment lives with it.<\/p>\n\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"678\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/6791940537_40b7d0ac00_b.jpg\" alt=\"boiler pipes heating system\" class=\"wp-image-187\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/6791940537_40b7d0ac00_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/6791940537_40b7d0ac00_b-300x199.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/6791940537_40b7d0ac00_b-768x509.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--stock\" title=\"&quot;20110719-RD-LSC-0205&quot; by USDAgov, BY, via Openverse\">Stock<\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text\" style=\"grid-template-columns:50% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-filter-1.png\" alt=\"filter - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1774\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-filter-1.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-filter-1-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-filter-1-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-filter-1-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The filter is the lease&#039;s cheapest insurance<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Most rental HVAC failures trace back to airflow, and most airflow problems trace back to a one-inch filter that has not been touched since the previous tenants moved in. A loaded filter starves the blower. In cooling season that drops coil temperature until the evaporator ices into a solid block; in heating season it pushes furnace temperatures high enough to trip the limit switch over and over.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A part that costs less than a pizza quietly takes out components that cost more than a semester&#039;s rent. Leases usually assign filter changes to the tenant, and in practice that means they do not happen. The fix is structural, not motivational.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Either the owner supplies dated filters at turnover and mid-lease, or the unit gets converted to a four-or-five-inch media cabinet that genuinely lasts a full lease cycle on one element. The media cabinet costs more once and then removes the human factor entirely \u2014 which, in student housing, is the entire game.<\/p>\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--ink has-contrast-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--sand has-tint-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Five service pillars for rental portfolios<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide s-feature-row is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg\" alt=\"hvac technician repair\" class=\"wp-image-188\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--stock\" title=\"&quot;AC Service&quot; by SuperTech HVAC Services, BY-SA, via Openverse\">Stock<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Turnover inspections<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Late July walkthrough: filter swap, condensate flush, outdoor coil rinse, thermostat reset. Dated photos for the file.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-thermostat-2.png\" alt=\"thermostat - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1762\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-thermostat-2.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-thermostat-2-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-thermostat-2-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-thermostat-2-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Thermostat lockouts<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Smart devices with software-enforced ranges protect equipment and prevent tenant-induced pipe freezes mid-winter.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez3-filter.png\" alt=\"filter - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1795\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez3-filter.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez3-filter-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez3-filter-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez3-filter-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Filter management<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dated filter supply at move-in and mid-lease, or media cabinet conversion. Tenants almost never change them voluntarily.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-1024x683.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1475\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-1024x683.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-768x512.png 768w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gpt-image-1)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Seasonal protocols<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">September heating check, mid-December vacancy hold-temp verification, March cooling start-up, May move-out condition photos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-1024x683.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1476\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-1024x683.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-768x512.png 768w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gpt-image-1)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Per-unit documentation<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One-page equipment record: make, model, serial, install year, filter size, refrigerant type, dated service entries.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--warm-gradient has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The thermostat paradox<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-indent has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A basic dial thermostat in a rental is an open invitation: eighty-five in January, sixty in July, and no record of any of it. Modern rental practice replaces it with a thermostat whose range can be locked in software \u2014 generous enough that no reasonable tenant ever feels the ceiling, tight enough that the equipment is protected from the extremes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pennsylvania landlords owe tenants adequate heat under their leases and local housing codes, so the right posture is a wide, comfortable heating range with hard stops only at the silly ends. The quieter benefit is visibility: a connected thermostat reports runtime, and runtime is diagnosis at a distance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A compressor calling continuously since Tuesday means an open window, a failed capacitor, or a refrigerant problem \u2014 and you find out in July, not from a utility bill in September.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--cream has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Semester-aware service calendar<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list s-steps\">\n<li>Late July\u2013Early August \u2014 Per-unit turnover walkthrough during occupancy transition. Filter, condensate line, outdoor coil, thermostat range reset, dated photos.<\/li>\n\n\n<li>September \u2014 Heating inspection and combustion check before first frost, while evenings remain easy to book.<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Mid-December \u2014 Vacancy protocol: holding temperature verified on each unit emptying for winter break, low-temp alerts armed.<\/li>\n\n\n<li>March\u2013April \u2014 Cooling start-up check so window units and central systems are proven before the first warm stretch.<\/li>\n\n\n<li>May \u2014 Move-out condition photos of grilles, thermostats, and mechanical spaces, shot against August&#039;s baseline.<\/li>\n\n<\/ul>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--sand has-tint-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-quote s-quote--mark has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>Equipment that nobody owns lives with you when the lease turns over. Documentation is the difference between a mystery box and an asset.<\/p><cite>Centre County landlord handbook<\/cite><\/blockquote><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Documentation wins every later argument<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every unit deserves a one-page equipment record: make, model, serial, install year, filter size, refrigerant type, and a dated line for every service visit. It sounds like clerical fuss until the first time you need it. Manufacturer warranty claims on compressors and heat exchangers routinely ask for proof of maintenance; a stack of dated service entries is the difference between a covered part and a full-price one.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The same file settles smaller disputes before they start. Security-deposit conversations about a bent fin grille or a thermostat pried off the wall go quickly when there is an August photo and a May photo. Repair-versus-replace decisions stop being guesswork when the record shows this is the third ignitor in four heating seasons.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you run more than a couple of units, put the records where your service company can write to them too. A shared log means the technician who shows up in February already knows what the technician in August found.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--ink has-contrast-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list s-pills s-pills--glass\">\n<li>August turnover: 3,000+ units flip simultaneously<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Smart thermostats prevent 60\u00b0F pipe freezes<\/li>\n\n\n<li>6,400 heating degree days in Centre County<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Per-unit docs add $2,000\u20135,000 at sale<\/li>\n\n\n<li>One frozen-pipe incident costs $8,000\u201315,000<\/li>\n\n\n<li>45-minute inspections catch 90% of problems<\/li>\n\n<\/ul>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading has-text-align-center wp-block-heading\">What State College landlords ask<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-accordion s-accordion--minimal has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-1583283a wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>Am I allowed to limit the thermostat range in my rental?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Setting software limits on a thermostat you own is generally fine, provided the unit still receives adequate heat under your lease and the housing codes your rental permit is inspected against. Keep the heating range generous \u2014 the goal is blocking the extremes that damage equipment, not rationing comfort \u2014 and put the policy in the lease so nobody discovers it by surprise.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>Should the lease make tenants responsible for filters?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Write it in if you like, but budget as though the answer is you. Filter neglect damages your equipment, not theirs, and no lease clause repairs a cracked heat exchanger. Supplying dated filters at turnover and mid-lease, or installing a media cabinet sized to last the lease, protects the asset regardless of who technically owed the chore.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>What temperature should an empty unit hold over winter break?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A common holding point is fifty-five degrees, warm enough to protect plumbing in most layouts while trimming fuel use. The number matters less than the verification: pipes on exterior walls may need more margin, low-temperature alerts should be armed before the unit empties, and someone should walk the building at least once during the closure.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>How do I schedule service around August turnover when every contractor is booked?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Book turnover work in late July, before move-in weekend. Every service company fills September in 48 hours once students move in. A turnover baseline also lets you stagger repairs across the summer instead of facing everything at once when tenants arrive.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--dark-gradient has-contrast-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Put your portfolio on one baseline<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A baseline visit walks every unit you own, records each system&#039;s age, condition, filter size, and measured performance, flags the equipment likely to fail within a lease term, and hands you the per-unit file \u2014 ready for warranty claims, deposit disputes, and turnover planning.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Book the baseline<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading has-text-align-center wp-block-heading\">Our Work in Your Neighborhood<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery alignwide has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped s-gallery wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1755\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1755\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"357\" data-id=\"191\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/3359389452_125c1ce535_b.jpg\" alt=\"unfinished basement\" class=\"wp-image-191\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/3359389452_125c1ce535_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/3359389452_125c1ce535_b-300x105.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-